{"sha": "47645b8d9123b34f3e14e95d92c6137846acdfde2b992a1f655f64689149b091", "body": ["\\medskip", "\\noindent\\textbf{第二部分 --- 夹逼收尾：欧拉", "定理。}", "\\begin{enumerate}[resume]", "  \\item 对 $k = 1, \\dots, n$ 求和第 6 题，取 $\\theta =", "        \\theta_k$，证明：", "        \\[", "        \\frac{n(2n-1)}{3} \\;<\\;", "        \\frac{(2n+1)^2}{\\pi^2}\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\frac1{k^2}", "        \\;<\\; \\frac{2n(n+1)}{3}.", "        \\]", "  \\item 由此得出（\\emph{欧拉定理，柯西证法}）：", "        \\[", "        \\zeta(2) = \\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{k^2} =", "        \\frac{\\pi^2}{6}.", "        \\]", "  \\item 由夹逼式推出收敛速度，证明：", "        \\[", "        \\Bigl|\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\frac1{k^2} - \\frac{\\pi^2}6\\Bigr|", "        = O\\Bigl(\\frac1n\\Bigr),", "        \\]", "        与 $\\sum_{k>n}k^{-2} =", "        \\frac1n - \\frac{1}{2n^2} + O(n^{-3})$ 的级数余项相符，", "        见\\cref{exo:b2:comparison:11}。", "  \\item 把方法再推进一层：利用", "        $P_n$ 的第二个韦达函数，证明", "        \\[", "        \\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\cot^4\\theta_k =", "        \\Bigl(\\frac{n(2n-1)}3\\Bigr)^{\\!2} -", "        \\frac{2n(2n-1)(2n-2)(2n-3)}{60}", "        \\;\\sim\\; \\frac{8n^4}{45},", "        \\]", "        并用 $\\cot^4 < \\theta^{-4} < (1 +", "        \\cot^2)^2$ 夹逼，得 $\\zeta(4) = \\dfrac{\\pi^4}{90}$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "", "\\medskip", "\\noindent\\textbf{第三部分 --- 收益。}", "\\begin{enumerate}[resume]", "  \\item 由 $\\zeta(2) = \\frac{\\pi^2}6$ 推出：", "        \\[", "        \\sum_{k\\geq0}\\frac{1}{(2k+1)^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}{8},", "        \\qquad", "        \\sum_{k\\geq1}\\frac{(-1)^{k-1}}{k^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}{12}.", "        \\]", "  \\item 结合 \\cref{exo:b2:series:7}，计算 $S =", "        \\sum_{\\gcd(a,b)=1}\\frac{1}{a^2b^2} =", "        \\frac{\\zeta(2)^2}{\\zeta(4)} = \\frac52$，并解释", "        $\\frac{1}{\\zeta(2)} = \\frac{6}{\\pi^2} \\approx 0.608$ 为", "        互素数对的密度（诚实地说明启发式，严格的", "        计数是本科三年级分册的内容", "        ）。", "  \\item （可验证的加速）由第 9 题的余项公式", "        可得 $\\sum_{k\\leq n}k^{-2} + \\frac1n - \\frac1{2n^2} =", "        \\frac{\\pi^2}6 + O(n^{-3})$。比较求得", "        $\\zeta(2)$ 的六位数字所需的工作量：直接求和与", "        $n = 100$ 时的修正和（此时误差为", "        $1.7\\cdot10^{-7}$）。", "  \\item 手算第 4 题，取 $n = 1$ 与 $n = 2$（其值分别为", "        $\\cot^2\\frac\\pi3 = \\frac13$ 与", "        $\\cot^2\\frac\\pi5 + \\cot^2\\frac{2\\pi}5 = 2$），利用", "        $\\cos\\frac\\pi5 = \\frac{1+\\sqrt5}4$ 或数值", "        计算。", "  \\item 证明配套恒等式", "        \\[", "        \\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\tan^2\\frac{k\\pi}{2n+1} = n(2n+1)", "        \\]", "        \\emph{（数 $\\tan^2\\theta_k$ 是反向多项式", "        $x^nP_n(1/x)$ 的根）}，并在 $n", "        = 1$ 时验证。", "\\end{enumerate}", "", "\\medskip", "\\noindent\\textbf{第四部分 --- 伯特兰概览。}设 $\\alpha,", "\\beta \\in \\R$，考虑\\emph{伯特兰级数}", "\\[", "\\sum_{n \\geq 3} \\frac{1}{n^{\\alpha}(\\ln n)^{\\beta}} .", "\\]", "\\begin{enumerate}[resume]", "  \\item 证明：当 $\\alpha > 1$ 时，级数收敛，", "        无论 $\\beta$ 取何值 \\emph{（与", "        $n^{-(1+\\alpha)/2}$ 比较）}。", "  \\item 证明：当 $\\alpha < 1$ 时级数发散，无论", "        $\\beta$ 取何值。", "  \\item 当 $\\alpha = 1$ 时，利用级数--积分比较", "        （\\cref{thm:b2:comparison:seriesintegral}），取 $f(t) =", "        \\frac{1}{t(\\ln t)^\\beta}$，证明当且仅当 $\\beta", "        > 1$ 时收敛。", "  \\item 进一步迭代这一临界：证明 $\\sum\\frac{1}{n\\ln n\\,\\ln\\ln", "        n}$ 发散，而 $\\sum\\frac{1}{n\\ln n\\,(\\ln\\ln n)^2}$", "        收敛。", "  \\item 两个陷阱：判断下列级数的敛散性", "        \\[", "        \\sum_n \\frac{1}{n^{1 + 1/\\ln n}}", "        \\qquad\\text{ 与 }\\qquad", "        \\sum_n \\frac{1}{n^{1 + 1/\\ln\\ln n}}", "        \\]", "        \\emph{（精确计算 $n^{1/\\ln n}$；比较", "        $n^{1/\\ln\\ln n}$ 与 $\\ln n$ 的任意幂）}。", "  \\item （不存在最慢的收敛级数）设 $\\sum a_n$ 为任一", "        收敛级数，其中 $a_n > 0$，且 $R_n = \\sum_{k", "        \\geq n}a_k$ 为其余项。证明 $\\sum", "        \\frac{a_n}{\\sqrt{R_n}}$ 仍 \\emph{收敛}", "        \\emph{（与裂项和 $2(\\sqrt{R_n} -", "        \\sqrt{R_{n+1}})$ 作比较）}，虽然 $\\frac{a_n/\\sqrt{R_n}}{a_n}", "        \\to \\infty$，但每一收敛级数都被另一收敛级数", "        严格控制。收敛的临界", "        不是一条曲线，而是一团雾。", "\\end{enumerate}", ""]}